          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP566 - Beaverlodge 2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ditch was a little moist, but easily jump - I was too lazy to walk around.  There are marker post and stakes all over, but I made the find of the cap that has seen many tool hitting it.  #6 today  TFTH&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
