          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP 566&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beaverlodge (Town)

N 55 12.848 W 119 26.176  Elev = 724&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice cap that got my feet wet while jumping over the drainage ditch. I decided it had been exactly 32 years since I had worked in this town. Came to see a beaver and I wasn`t disappointed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TFTBCP Email already sent to CO &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks OFTH&lt;/p&gt;

