          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP566 Beaverlodge 2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The sun was starting to drop in the sky a bit by this point in time and the energy levels were falling just as fast. Luckily this was a quick find of a very beaten up cap in a hole.&lt;/p&gt;
